Right — add a `Root` entry so the walker visits outward from root, then build the graph and spawn it:

```jac
node Person {
    has name: str;
    has age: int;
}

edge Knows {
    has since: int;
}

walker Greeter {
    can greet with Root entry {
        visit [-->];
    }

