Here's the walker. One ability fires at `Root entry` and kicks off the traversal with `visit [-->]`, another fires on each `Person entry` to greet and flag them:

```jac
node Person {
    has name: str;
    has visited: bool = False;
}

walker Greeter {
    can start with Root entry {
        visit [-->];
    }

    can greet with Person entry {
        print(f"Hello, {here.name}!");
