Yes. Root-entry finds or creates today's day, then a Day-entry step attaches the visitor. Here's the find-or-create part:

```jac
can run with Root entry {
    visit [root-->[?:Day, date == today]] else {
        fresh_day = root +>: OnDay() :+> Day(date=today);
