A set won't preserve order, so I'll track seen values explicitly and build the output in order:

```jac
def dedupe(items: list) -> list {
    seen = [];
    out = [];
    for x in items {
        if x not in seen {
            seen.append(x);
            out.append(x);
        }
    }
    return out;
}

