    for c in cases {
        print(str(_is_lib(c[0], c[1])));
    }
}
```

The Darwin branch ANDs the `libraylib` prefix with the `.dylib` suffix; the else branch's `startswith("libraylib.so")` also catches versioned names like `libraylib.so.5`.

